                    "max": 2147483647,
                    "defaultData": 1,
                    "mandatory": false,
                    "description": "<p>The motor's torque constant is given by the motor design it defines the torque generated per effective current(rms). The value needs to be configured in &mu;Nm/Arms</p>",
